## 0. Principles (non-negotiable)
- The local engine is always the source of truth. Cloud results may ADD
  information or RAISE a verdict. They can NEVER lower a verdict or score.
- Cloud features are OFF by default, require explicit opt-in, and can be
  disabled at any time. With cloud disabled or unreachable, every scan still
