  extraction rules that exclude the database and preferences),
  usesCleartextTraffic=false, exported flags set explicitly, minimal
  permissions only. Choose minSdk and targetSdk based on the CURRENT Google
  Play and Android requirements (check them, record them in the docs).
  Enable R8/ProGuard for release with keep rules where needed.

## 2. Kotlin engine (android/native/engine, a pure Kotlin/JVM module)
Create a Gradle module with NO Android dependencies so it can be unit-tested
on the JVM and reused by services in 5B.
- Public API mirrors the TS engine: scan(input, pack) -> ScanResult, plus
  loadRulePack(json), validateRulePack, getVersion. Data classes mirror
  types.ts exactly (same field names, same enum values, JSON-serialisable
  with kotlinx.serialization).
