  c) Privacy test: serialised result must not contain input text.
  d) Determinism, override-never-lowers, score cap, time-budget tests.
  e) Performance sanity check on a 2,000-character message.
- Target: ZERO conformance failures. If a vector cannot pass for a
  documented reason, list it explicitly in docs/ENGINE_REPORT.md and
